        {"zh": "我笑着，其实很专注", "en": "I'm laughing, but I'm focused."},
        {"zh": "这段距离正好够", "en": "Just the right distance."},
        {"zh": "我扑过去会太快", "en": "If I pounce, it'll be too quick."},
